                %a{:href => "http://scipp.ucsc.edu/~haber/webpage/pfaffian.pdf"} pdf
          %p
            There is also a deformed noncommutative version of Pfaffian related to
            = succeed "s:" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quantum+linear+group"} quantum linear group
          %ul
            %li
              Naihuan Jing, Jian Zhang,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Quantum Pfaffians and hyper-Pfaffians
              %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/1309.5530"} arxiv/1309.5530
          %p Pfaffian variety is subject of 4.4 in
          %ul
            %li
              Alexander Kuznetsov,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Semiorthogonal decompositions in algebraic geometry
              %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/1404.3143"} arxiv/1404.3143
          %p
            Relation to
            = succeed "-functions" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi τ
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \tau
          %ul
            %li
