              = succeed "," do
                %em Pfaffian and determinantal tau functions I
              %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/1404.6076"} arxiv/1404.6076
          %p Other articles:
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                András C. Lőrincz, Claudiu Raicu, Uli Walther, Jerzy Weyman,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Bernstein-Sato polynomials for maximal minors and sub-maximal Pfaffians
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1601.06688"} arxiv/1601.06688
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Mauro+Spera"}> Mauro Spera
                ,
                %em
                  A C
                  %em –algebraic approach to determinants and Pfaffians, Acta Cosmologica Fasc. XXI-2, (1995) 203–208.
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Donald+E.+Knuth"}> Donald E. Knuth
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Overlapping Pfaffians
                = succeed ":2" do
                  %strong 3
                %a{:href => "https://www.emis.de/journals/EJC/Volume_3/PDFFiles/v3i2r5.pdf"} pdf
              %blockquote
                %p “A combinatorial construction proves an identity for the product of the Pfaffian of a skew-symmetric matrix by the Pfaffian of one of its submatrices. Several applications of this identity are followed by a brief history of Pfaffians.”
            %li
